  "question": "What\u2019s the closest restaurant aligned with the route to Karpeles Manuscript Library, Jacksonville, FL from Butterfield Garage Art Gallery, Saint Augustine, FL?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.319514 29.891225)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.656807 30.337046)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'restaurant'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.319514 29.891225)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.319514 29.891225)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
